on",alternateName:"Efloud",identifier:"1063939505827323904",image:"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2036249821804371969/QbSPb7JG_400x400.jpg",name:"Efloud",url:"https://x.com/Efloud"},comment:$R[16]=[$R[17]={"@id":"https://x.com/InkSist/status/2024785148571439191","@type":"Comment",author:$R[18]={"@type":"Person",alternateName:"InkSist",identifier:"1796859896450699264",image:"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1812079984330035200/8cjSSW0F_400x400.jpg",name:"ˌinkənˈsist(ə)nt",url:"https://x.com/InkSist"},commentCount:1,datePublished:"2026-02-20T09:56:12.000Z",identifier:"2024785148571439191",interactionStatistic:$R[19]=[$R[20]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/LikeAction",name:"Likes",url:"https://x.com/InkSist/status/2024785148571439191/likes",userInteractionCount:3},$R[21]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/ShareAction",name:"Retweets",url:"https://x.com/InkSist/status/2024785148571439191/retweets",userInteractionCount:0},$R[22]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/ReplyAction",name:"Replies",userInteractionCount:1},$R[23]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/ViewAction",name:"Views",userInteractionCount:836}],text:"@Efloud Eline sağlık .. KOZAL (yeni adı TRALT) paylaşmıştınız güncelleme varmı :)"},$R[24]={"@id":"https://x.com/cryptotiks/status/2024803480435638622","@type":"Comment",author:$R[25]={"@type":"Person",alternateName:"cryptotiks",identifier:"1423650245939011593",image:"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1609620971882778626/4ZfJlskr_400x400.jpg",name:"Kriptotiks👁‍🗨",url:"https://x.com/cryptotiks"},commentCount:1,datePublished:"2026-02-20T11:09:03.000Z",identifier:"2024803480435638622",interactionStatistic:$R[26]=[$R[27]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/LikeAction",name:"Likes",url:"https://x.com/cryptotiks/status/2024803480435638622/likes",userInteractionCount:5},$R[28]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/ShareAction",name:"Retweets",url:"https://x.com/cryptotiks/status/2024803480435638622/retweets",userInteractionCount:0},$R[29]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/ReplyAction",name:"Replies",userInteractionCount:1},$R[30]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/ViewAction",name:"Views",userInteractionCount:762}],text:"@Efloud Bu kredili özelliği gördüğümde çok beğenmiştim ben de hocam. Ancak kesinlikle ve kesinlikle elde olan miktar kadar kullanmak şart. Acil durum planı gibi düşünmek lazım. Kapatılabilecek miktarlardan fazlası sıkıntı yaratabilr. \n\nAnalizler için de teşekkürler❤️"},$R[31]={"@id":"https://x.com/CataaYeto/status/2024931713999159701","@type":"Comment",author:$R[32]={"@type":"Person",alternateName:"CataaYeto",identifier:"1726330102697299968",image:"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1983610705828814848/unW549Ye_400x400.jpg",name:"cataa yeto",url:"https://x.com/CataaYeto"},commentCount:1,datePublished:"2026-02-20T19:38:36.000Z",identifier:"2024931713999159701",interactionStatistic:$R[33]=[$R[34]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/LikeAction",name:"Likes",url:"https://x.com/CataaYeto/status/2024931713999159701/likes",userInteractionCount:5},$R[35]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/ShareAction",name:"Retweets",url:"https://x.com/CataaYeto/status/2024931713999159701/retweets",userInteractionCount:0},$R[36]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/ReplyAction",name:"Replies",userInteractionCount:1},$R[37]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/ViewAction",name:"Views",userInteractionCount:102}],text:"@Efloud Konu 32: Acı ama Gerçek. Hocam son dersi bitirdim. Şimdi ilk derse dönüp tekrar yapıp arkasına backtest başlıcam\nSenden 3 parite istesem. Hem backtest yapıyım, yalayıp yutayım pariteyi hem de 10 yılda gelir kapısı edineyim. Hangi Fx pariteleri uygun olur.\nŞimdiden teşekkürler"}],commentCount:13,identifier:"2024784927967846807",interactionStatistic:$R[38]=[$R[39]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/LikeAction",name:"Likes",url:"https://x.com/Efloud/status/2024784927967846807/likes",userInteractionCount:291},$R[40]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/ShareAction",name:"Retweets",url:"https://x.com/Efloud/status/2024784927967846807/retweets",userInteractionCount:14},$R[41]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/ReplyAction",name:"Replies",userInteractionCount:13},$R[42]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/ViewAction",name:"Views",userInteractionCount:69758}],sharedContent:$R[43]={"@id":"https://x.com/i/status/2022640411458625979","@type":"SocialMediaPosting",author:$R[44]={"@type":"Person",alternateName:"Efloud",identifier:"1063939505827323904",image:"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2036249821804371969/QbSPb7JG_400x400.jpg",name:"Efloud",url:"https://x.com/Efloud"},identifier:"2022640411458625979",text:"#XU100 &amp; $ASELS &amp; $GARAN | Detaylı Güncelleme\n\nMerhabalar,\nAylık olarak paylaştığım endeks ve beğendiğim/yatırımımın olduğu hisselere dair genel bir güncellemedir; gazete niteliği taşımaktadır. Yazı boyunca ilgili başlıklardan kendiniz için anlam ifade edenleri takip"},text:"#XU100 &amp; $GARAN | Güncelleme &amp; Midas Kredi Özelliği\n\nMerhabalar,\n\nDün ciddi bir satış baskısı gören fiyat ile portföyümdeki GYO ve bankacılık sektöründe olan paritelerden kısmi kâr realizasyonu gerçekleştirdim. Yükseliş trendinin bozulduğunu henüz düşünmüyorum, ancak XU100"}],mediaPreviewImageUrl:"https://jf.x.com/images/media-preview/2024784927967846807",publishedTime:"2026-02-20T09:55:20.000Z",replyCount:13,socialTitle:"Efloud (@Efloud) on X",title:"Efloud on X: \"#XU100 &amp; $GARAN | Güncelleme &amp; Midas Kredi Özelliği\n\nMerhabalar,\n\nDün ciddi bir satış baskısı gören fiyat ile portfö